   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Masimanyane Women&apos;s Support Centre of East London, South Africa and Kvinnojouren Bl&#xE5;klockan of G&#xE4;vle, Sweden are planning to cooperate in addressing the issue of violence against women in their respective organisations and countries. The cooperation goals are to initiate exchanges between the respective organisations with a view to developing the partnership; to share both organisations&apos; models and e</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Planerings bidrag - Masimanyane Kvinnosupportcenter i East London, Sydafrika och Kvinnojouren Bl&#xE5;klockan i G&#xE4;vle. Samarbete f&#xF6;r om v&#xE5;ld mot kvinnor i respektive organisationer och l&#xE4;nder med m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att inleda ett utbyte mellan respektive organisationer, att utveckla partnerskap och dela de b&#xE5;da organisationernas modeller och  erfarenheter.</narrative>
